VALUES ('TERMS_CONTENT', '[{"title":"1. About These Terms","content":["These Terms and Conditions govern your use of Vaibhav Vivaaha Matrimony, an online matrimony service operated from Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India — our website at vaibhavvivaahamatrimony.com and our mobile app, which share a single member account. By registering, signing in or using the service, you agree to these Terms, our Privacy Policy, our Subscription Policy and our Refund & Cancellation Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the service."]},{"title":"2. Who Can Register","content":["Vaibhav Vivaaha is a matrimonial service intended only for people genuinely seeking marriage. To register, you must:","• be at least 18 years old if you are a woman, or at least 21 years old if you are a man — the minimum legal ages for marriage in India;","• be legally free to marry, and state your marital status truthfully in your profile;","• register only one profile for yourself.","• A parent, sibling or relative may create and manage a profile on behalf of the person seeking marriage, but only with that person’s knowledge and consent."]},{"title":"3. Your Account and Profile","content":["• The information you provide must be accurate, current and your own. Do not use another person’s photographs or identity.","• Every new profile is reviewed by our team before it is shown to other members. We may approve a profile, reject it, or ask you to correct it.","• Keep your PIN confidential. You are responsible for all activity on your account, including activity through any Family Access login you create.","• You can edit your profile, hide selected details from other members, or delete your account at any time."]},{"title":"4. Acceptable Use","content":["You agree not to use the service to:","• create a fake, duplicate or misleading profile, or impersonate anyone;","• harass, threaten, abuse, stalk or discriminate against any member;","• ask any member for money, gifts, loans or financial details, or promote any scheme, business or investment;","• seek casual relationships, or use the service for any purpose other than marriage;","• share another member’s contact details, photographs or conversations outside the service without their consent;","• upload obscene, offensive or unlawful content, or content that infringes anyone’s rights;","• copy, scrape or harvest profiles or contact details, or interfere with the service or its security."]},{"title":"5. Safety, Verification and Reporting","content":["We review profiles and offer optional verification, but we cannot confirm every detail a member provides. Before committing to an alliance, members and their families should independently verify background, family, education, employment and financial details. Never send money to anyone you meet through the service. If a member behaves inappropriately, use the Report or Block options in the app, or contact us."]},{"title":"6. Content You Share","content":["You keep ownership of the photographs, text and documents you upload. You give us permission to store, display and process that content only to operate the service — for example, to show your profile to other members. You confirm that you have the right to share it. We may remove any content that breaches these Terms."]},{"title":"7. Interests, Messages and Contact Details","content":["Your mobile number and email address are shared with another member only after you accept their interest, and only if their membership includes contact access. By using the service, you agree to be contacted by members you have connected with, and by our team by phone, WhatsApp, SMS or email about your account, your profile and your membership."]},{"title":"8. Paid Memberships and Payments","content":["Registration is free. Paid memberships unlock additional features; their prices and validity are set out on our plans page and in our Subscription Policy.","• Every paid membership and add-on is a one-time purchase. There is no automatic renewal and no recurring charge.","• Online payments are processed by our payment partner, Cashfree Payments. Card, UPI and banking details are entered on Cashfree’s secure pages and are never collected or stored by us.","• A membership is activated after we receive and verify confirmation of a successful payment from our payment partner, and remains active for the validity shown at the time of purchase. A debit from your account alone does not mean the membership is already active.","• Membership fees are non-refundable once a membership has been successfully purchased and activated, including where a member changes their mind, does not use the membership, is dissatisfied with the available profiles or features, or does not find a suitable match. Refunds may be considered only for duplicate payments, payments successfully deducted but not credited to the membership, other payment or technical errors, or where required by law — subject to verification. See our Refund & Cancellation Policy for details."]},{"title":"9. No Guarantee of a Match","content":["We work to help you find a suitable life partner, but we do not guarantee that you will receive interests, find a match or get married, or that any member will respond to you. The outcome of any alliance is a personal decision between the families involved."]},{"title":"10. Suspension and Termination","content":["We may suspend or permanently remove any account that breaches these Terms, provides false information, or puts other members at risk. Where an account is removed for a breach, membership fees already paid are not refunded. You may stop using the service and delete your account at any time from the app, or at vaibhavvivaahamatrimony.com/delete-account."]},{"title":"11. Privacy and Security","content":["How we collect, use, share, protect and delete your personal information is explained in our Privacy Policy, which forms part of these Terms."]},{"title":"12. Limitation of Liability","content":["The service is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. We are not responsible for the conduct of any member, for the accuracy of information members provide, or for decisions you make based on it. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect or consequential loss, and our total liability to you for any claim is limited to the amount you paid us for the membership concerned."]},{"title":"13. Governing Law and Disputes","content":["These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute will first be addressed through our grievance process and, if it is not resolved, will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India."]},{"title":"14. Changes to These Terms","content":["We may update these Terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows the current version. If a change materially affects your rights, we will let you know in the app or by email before it takes effect. Continuing to use the service after that means you accept the updated Terms."]},{"title":"15. Contact Us","content":["Questions about these Terms? Call or WhatsApp +91 79045 47565, or email support@vaibhavvivaahamatrimony.com, Monday to Saturday, 10 AM to 8 PM (closed on Sundays). For complaints, write to the same email address with the subject “Grievance”."]}]');
